    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c27b3ab3c8@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) will participate in Deutsche Bank's&nbsp;43rd&nbsp;Annual&nbsp;Health Care Conference on Tuesday, May 8, 2018&nbsp;at the Intercontinental Hotel Boston. Katherine Owen, Vice President, Strategy and Investor Relations, will represent the Company in a presentation scheduled for 8:00 a.m. Eastern Time.</p>\n<p>See full press release <a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-to-participate-in-Deutsche-Banks-43rd-Annual-Health-Care-Conference/default.aspx\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
